{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Izuku Midoriya: Origin\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-03\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Izuku Midoriya desperately wants to be a hero, but he is one of the few in his generation born without a Quirk. Will meeting the number one hero, All Might, change his fate?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5465180.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"緑谷出久: オリジン\"},{\"title\":\"What It Takes to Be a Hero\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-10\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Izuku accidentally learns of All Might's secret, but there's trouble in town again before Izuku has time to process it. Will All Might be able to save the day again?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5569820.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒーローの条件\"},{\"title\":\"Roaring Muscles\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-17\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"All Might tells Izuku that he can become a hero, but does he really have what it takes to become one?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5569821.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"うなれ筋肉\"},{\"title\":\"Start Line\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2016-04-24\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"At the entrance exam, Izuku falls behind as the other students defeat faux villains left and right. Will he be able to get enough points to pass?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5569822.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"スタートライン\"},{\"title\":\"What I Can Do for Now\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"It's Izuku's first day of high school, and he still can't control his new Quirk. Will he make it to the second day of school with his eccentric new teacher?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570618.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"今 僕に出来ることを\"},{\"title\":\"Rage, You Damn Nerd\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Izuku somehow gets through his first day of school and falls into a regular schedule of classes and training at U.A. In their first class with All Might...\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570619.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"猛れクソナード\"},{\"title\":\"Deku vs. Kacchan\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"In All Might's first class, Izuku will have to face off against Katsuki! As the hero team, can Izuku and Uraraka beat the villain team of Katsuki and Tenya?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570620.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"デクvsかっちゃん\"},{\"title\":\"Bakugo`s Start Line\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After the combat training lesson, the students and All Might reflect on their matches as they think about their next steps.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570621.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"スタートライン, 爆豪の.\"},{\"title\":\"Yeah, Just Do Your Best, Iida!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2016-05-29\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Class 1-A has to elect a class representative, and everyone wants the job! How will they choose? And what lies in wait for them at the next class?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570622.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"いいぞガンバレ飯田くん!\"},{\"title\":\"Encounter with the Unknown\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-05\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Villains have attacked USJ, and it's up to Class 1-A to stop them. What are the villains after? Will All Might be able to save the day again?\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570623.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"未知との遭遇\"},{\"title\":\"Game Over\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-12\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The students fight for their lives against the Villains while Iida manages to escape with his friends' help. Once knowing that Iida will warn the other teachers who will come to stop them, the Villains' leader Tomura Shigaraki decides to kill Izuku and his friends just to hurt All Might's pride before they leave, when All Might himself appears.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570624.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ゲームオーバー\"},{\"title\":\"All Might\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-19\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"All Might has finally shown up, but will he be able to defeat Nomu and save the day?!\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570625.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"オールマイト\"},{\"title\":\"In Each of Our Hearts\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2016-06-26\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As the battle at USJ winds down, Izuku and All Might think about its repercussions. Meanwhile, the villains slink home to plan their next move.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/305074/5570626.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"各々の胸に\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}